This product includes a copy of the Personal Agent Protocol specification, version 1.0,
in spec/, retrieved from the repository of the Personal Agent Protocol project at
https://github.com/personal-agent-protocol/personal-agent-protocol and licensed by that
project under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

Each page in spec/ was verified against the sha256 value the project publishes for it in
content/versions/versions.json. spec/PROVENANCE.json records the commit, the hashes and
the result, so a reader can confirm that the copy is unmodified.

This product also includes a copy of the signing code from the Company implementation kit
of the same project, in reference/jose.ts, licensed by that project under the Apache
License, Version 2.0. It is used as a test oracle: the suite mints conforming traffic with
it and requires every check to pass. reference/PROVENANCE.json records where it came from,
the sha256 of the kit archive it was taken from, and the sha256 of the file itself, which
the suite verifies before using it.
